{#
/**
 * @file
 * The icon before an event's date lines, the same on cards, teasers and
 * the event page:
 *   - repeat   — Phosphor arrows-clockwise, before "Every Monday, 7pm".
 *   - calendar — Phosphor calendar-dots, before a date or "Next: …".
 *
 * Decorative: the words carry the meaning, so the icon is hidden from
 * assistive technology.
 *
 * Variables:
 *   - icon:  'repeat' or 'calendar' (anything else draws the calendar).
 *   - class: the wrapper's class(es); the host's own icon class, so each
 *            surface sizes and colours it as it does its other icons.
 */
#}
<span class="{{ class|default('slnt-when-icon') }}" aria-hidden="true">
